--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5243d49411170e49a1bac6c9ca10949, type: 3}
  m_Name: Passage_Act3_School1Floor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SundayLastBreath.Data.StoryPassageData
  passageId: Act3_School1Floor
  passageTitle: ACT3 SCHOOL1FLOOR
  associatedRoomId: hall_1_center
  backdropSprite: {fileID: 0}
  keepPreviousBackdrop: 0
  animatedBackdropFrames: []
  animationFPS: 8
  musicAction: 0
  backgroundMusicOrAmbience: {fileID: 0}
  musicVolume: 0.5
  entranceSFX: {fileID: 0}
  sfxVolume: 0.8
  speakerName: 
  storyText: /* --- NODE MAPPER & NORMALIZER --- */
  narrativeBeats:
  - /* Calculate NPC talk & mission count for Reyes briefing unlock */
  - = 4 or _completedMissions >= 2 or $act3_reyes_triggered)>>
  - = 2 or _npcsVisited >= 4 or $act3_reyes_triggered)>>
  - "1ST FLOOR CORRIDOR \u2014"
  - '.map-viewport { height: 350px !important; border-color: var(--accent-blue) !important; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }'
  - You are on the upper level corridor. Carpeted floors muffle your footsteps. Trophy cases and administration plaques line the walls.
  - "\u2757 [MAIN QUEST AVAILABLE]\n\r\n                            Officer Reyes is waiting at the Center Corridor square (in front of Headmaster's Office) for your Command briefing.\r\n                        \r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                            \U0001F512 Command Briefing Locked: Talk with survivors in the safehouse (Canteen, Infirmary, Radio Room, Screening Room) or complete at least 2 missions to unlock Officer Reyes & Sanctuary Command briefing."
  - "/* CENTER HALLWAY (SQUARE IN FRONT OF HEADMASTER OFFICE) */\r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                                    \u2757 OFFICER REYES IS STANDING HERE IN FRONT OF THE HEADMASTER'S OFFICE\r\n                                \r\n                                \r\n                                    \r\n                                        \r\n                                        \r\n                                    \r\n                                    [MAIN QUEST] Reyes signals that Sanctuary Command is ready for your briefing."
  - Command office of Matriarch Evelyn.
  - "/* WEST HALLWAY 2: RADIO ROOM */\r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Chloe's frequency scanner & radio station."
  - "/* WEST HALLWAY 3: ROOM 201 */\r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Ammunition & weapon storage locker."
  - "/* WEST HALLWAY 4: ROOM 202 & ROOF */\r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Off-duty guard sleeping quarter.\r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Steel door to the rooftop lookout post."
  - "/* EAST HALLWAY 1: DEPARTMENT OFFICES */\r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Faculty lounge and records storage."
  - "/* EAST HALLWAY 2: LIBRARY */\r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Reference archives and skill textbooks."
  - "/* EAST HALLWAY 3: COMP LAB & SERVERS */\r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            Desktop terminals and local intranet.\r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                            \r\n                                \r\n                            \r\n                            School network infrastructure."
  - "\U0001F9ED CORRIDOR MOVEMENT:"
  - Descend West Stairs to Security Room Junction.
  - Descend East Stairs to Screening Junction.
  - "setTimeout(function() {\r\n    /* 1. Destroy the PDA map to prevent ID conflicts */\r\n    var pdaMap = document.getElementById(\"tab-map\");\r\n    if (pdaMap) {\r\n        pdaMap.innerHTML = \"[ MAP FEED ROUTED TO MAIN HUD ]\";\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    /* 2. Set a nice close-up zoom level for the main screen */\r\n    window.svgMapScale = 1.5;\r\n    \r\n    /* 3. Re-trigger the engine's map tracking on the visible map */\r\n    if (State.variables.currentLocation) {\r\n        window.updateMapGlow(State.variables.currentLocation);\r\n    }\r\n}, 150); /* 150ms delay ensures the passage is fully rendered before zooming */"
  dialogueLines: []
  initialFloorItems: []
